CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --apply-loop-contracts
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^\[main\.assigns\.\d+\] line \d+ Check that t is assignable: FAILURE$
--
--
Checks that a variable that the loop guard reads before the body writes it is
live at the loop head, so it is not a loop local.
